    "title": "The Temptations of Unfreedom Revisited",
    "text": "The Temptations of Unfreedom Revisited\n0 Comments\nThe populist wants you to feel. The algorithm wants you to click. One of the most subversive acts left is to sit still … and think\nJan 06 2026\n10 mins\nHow could a nation so intelligent be so blind? The answer is unsettling. This is not a mistake. It is a relapse\nDec 08 2025\n10 mins\nA government that weakens the link between welfare and work condemns its successors to the impossible task of re-establishing incentives to hold a job\nNov 19 2025\n9 mins",
